# What the M13 demo must show, in order: firmware boots the EFI-stub kernel
# from the ESP, IEx comes up on the serial console, and the machine really is
# running under EFI with the built-in command line.
elixos-shim: pid 1, version
iex(1)> File.dir?("/sys/firmware/efi")
true
iex(2)> String.trim(File.read!("/proc/cmdline"))
"console=ttyS0 panic=-1 quiet"
elixos-shim: shutdown poweroff
